{"id":"0a22ff5b7e4600356ccabfe571b7ffdad76064d7","axis":"silent","repo":"withastro/astro","sha":"0a22ff5b7e4600356ccabfe571b7ffdad76064d7","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/isr-edge-middleware.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@","+---","+'@astrojs/vercel': patch","+---","+","+Fixes `middlewareMode: 'edge'` not running your middleware when `isr` is also enabled","+","+Previously, enabling both options deployed the edge middleware but never reached it: requests went straight to the ISR function, which skips rendering entirely on a cache hit. Middleware now runs at the edge for ISR-backed routes before the cached response is served, and query strings are preserved when it forwards the request."],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/integrations/vercel/src/index.ts","lines":["@@ -32,7 +32,7 @@ import {"," \tgetInjectableWebAnalyticsContent,"," \ttype VercelWebAnalyticsConfig,"," } from './lib/web-analytics.js';","-import { generateEdgeMiddleware } from './serverless/middleware.js';","+import { generateEdgeMiddleware, type IsrForwarding } from './serverless/middleware.js';"," import { createConfigPlugin } from './vite-plugin-config.js';"," "," const PACKAGE_NAME = '@astrojs/vercel';","@@ -468,6 +468,10 @@ export default function vercelAdapter({"," \t\t\t\t\t);"," "," \t\t\t\t\tconst entryFile = new URL(_serverEntry, _buildTempFolder);","+\t\t\t\t\t// Routes the edge middleware forwards to `_isr` instead of `_render`.","+\t\t\t\t\tconst isrRoutes: string[] = [];","+\t\t\t\t\t// Checked first: a dynamic ISR route can also match an excluded path.","+\t\t\t\t\tconst isrExcludedRoutes: string[] = [];"," \t\t\t\t\tif (_buildOutput === 'server' && isr) {"," \t\t\t\t\t\tconst isrConfig = typeof isr === 'object' ? isr : {};"," \t\t\t\t\t\tawait builder.buildServerlessFolder(entryFile, NODE_PATH, _config.root);","@@ -485,10 +489,9 @@ export default function vercelAdapter({"," \t\t\t\t\t\t\tconst dest = _middlewareEntryPoint ? MIDDLEWARE_PATH : NODE_PATH